OL,3,GNEWSAMural honours airman who fought   
OL,4,Amid-air fire                           
OL,6,FA mural honouring a World War Two      
OL,7,Fflight engineer who climbed on to a    
OL,8,Fwing to try to put out a fire mid-air  
OL,9,Fhas been painted on the side of a      
OL,10,Fbuilding at a former airfield.         
OL,12,FThe artwork has been painted on the    
OL,13,Fwall of W A South & Sons in Martin     
OL,14,FMoor, Lincolnshire, part of the old RAF
OL,15,FMetheringham site.                     
OL,17,FIt pays tribute to Flt Sgt Norman Cyril
OL,18,FJackson, who was awarded the Victoria  
OL,19,FCross for his bravery after he         
OL,20,Fattempted to put out a fire while      
OL,21,Ftravelling on a Lancaster bomber that  
OL,22,Fhad been hit by enemy aircraft.        
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
