OL,3,GNEWSAMural honours airman who fought   
OL,4,Amid-air fire                           
OL,6,FArtist Steve Crowe, who painted it with
OL,7,Fcolleague Kieran Steels, said it was   
OL,8,Falso dedicated to those who lost their 
OL,9,Flives in the war: "It's very poignant  
OL,10,Fand the story is amazing."             
